module

public import Physlib.QuantumMechanics.BornCompositionCorrelation
public import Physlib.Meta.AxiomWhitelistCheck

/-!
# Audit of Born-distribution composition and correlation generation

This leaf audit applies the repository's axiom and non-vacuity gates to the
derived composition results: the Born-distribution pushforward under the Koopman
step, the vanishing correlation of a non-interacting product state, and the
strictly positive total correlation generated by the coupling shear.

The concrete demo distribution lemmas are the inhabiting witnesses; the gated
results are the pushforward bridge and the two correlation statements.
-/

open Physlib.QuantumMechanics.BornCompositionCorrelation

#check Physlib.QuantumMechanics.BornCompositionCorrelation.bornDist
